{"w":2400,"lines":[{"x":0.20987654416663398,"c":1,"t":"Test 1","y":0.10747938766851484,"w":0.055555553436279326,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"w":0.27197555541992191,"y":0.14776168800301603,"t":"READING PASSAGE 2","x":0.20969637057389293,"h":0.017725918683342945,"c":1},{"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 14-26, which are based on Reading","h":0.020885200185966735,"y":0.17986605880725337,"w":0.72461405436197912,"x":0.20969217825502748,"c":1},{"t":"Passage 2 below.","w":0.14814814249674477,"x":0.20987654589033497,"y":0.19611307445050263,"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"y":0.22957587940440727,"c":1,"w":0.57234858194986971,"x":0.28787075142274576,"t":"The growth of bike-sharing schemes around","h":0.023126143869999893},{"x":0.51028806885148414,"t":"the world","y":0.25290697700227116,"w":0.12551439921061192,"h":0.015988371257085632,"c":1},{"t":"How Dutch engineer Luud Schimmelpennink helped to devise urban","y":0.28287346112487288,"x":0.2425988694150765,"w":0.66496938069661449,"c":1,"h":0.021475707684304624},{"w":0.22427983601888019,"y":0.30087209285519156,"c":1,"x":0.45679012301054817,"h":0.017443572674538999,"t":"bike-sharing schemes"},{"w":0.71630884806315109,"t":"A The original idea for an urban bike-sharing scheme dates back to a summer's day","h":0.019090886110411431,"y":0.32981154216942676,"c":1,"x":0.2077026793255996},{"x":0.24680495598931676,"w":0.66687728881835939,"c":1,"y":0.34650513300469843,"t":"in Amsterdam in 1965. Provo, the organisation that came up with the idea, was a","h":0.018574913483205169},{"w":0.68338292439778647,"h":0.018817116992352778,"t":"group of Dutch activists who wanted to change society. They believed the scheme,","x":0.24680578109987381,"y":0.3620456092935409,"c":1},{"x":0.24679673038569527,"w":0.68746404012044271,"h":0.019098719943959841,"t":"which was known as the Witte Fietsenplan, was an answer to the perceived threats","y":0.37776823109506696,"c":1},{"y":0.39305052271980523,"t":"of air pollution and consumerism. In the centre of Amsterdam, they painted a small","x":0.24678608773635091,"w":0.68130935668945303,"h":0.019097625858230494,"c":1},{"t":"number of used bikes white. They also distributed leaflets describing the dangers of","h":0.017252417700310385,"c":1,"w":0.69150878906250002,"y":0.40907255167756151,"x":0.24683938959802787},{"t":"cars and inviting people to use the white bikes. The bikes were then left unlocked at","y":0.42390030130417544,"x":0.24681091955463369,"h":0.017923015868565595,"w":0.69156834920247401,"c":1},{"y":0.44004192249404817,"t":"various locations around the city, to be used by anyone in need of transport.","x":0.24682199362427146,"w":0.6277494812011718,"c":1,"h":0.01757264390008606},{"y":0.47093023236496467,"t":"B","w":0.012345678806304938,"h":0.010174418787512574,"x":0.2098765431894401,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Luud Schimmelpennink, a Dutch industrial engineer who still lives and cycles","x":0.24476122430181155,"y":0.47062777481000073,"h":0.017220411761208587,"w":0.63598744710286459},{"w":0.64609054565429691,"t":"in Amsterdam, was heavily involved in the original scheme. He recalls how the","x":0.24485596143013236,"h":0.016026036337772664,"y":0.48691860449979929,"c":1},{"y":0.50290697661012651,"c":1,"x":0.24691357570363912,"t":"scheme succeeded in attracting a great deal of attention - particularly when it","w":0.63991770426432293,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185,"x":0.24691358010973943,"y":0.51737338054821569,"t":"came to publicising Provo's aims - but struggled to get off the ground. The police","w":0.66666666666666674},{"h":0.014184353067961952,"t":"were opposed to Provo's initiatives and almost as soon as the white bikes were","c":1,"x":0.24686573410921123,"w":0.65237111409505211,"y":0.53253407002720943},{"c":1,"t":"distributed around the city, they removed them. However, for Schimmelpennink and","x":0.24680507049813191,"y":0.54767021170794228,"h":0.018502010754336995,"w":0.68536921183268229},{"w":0.65459899902343743,"y":0.56245122653248858,"c":1,"h":0.019480490712591503,"x":0.24470083028009357,"t":"for bike-sharing schemes in general, this was just the beginning. 'The first Witte"},{"w":0.68330841064453118,"x":0.24682131583595188,"h":0.018656390294590652,"c":1,"y":0.57743072469575063,"t":"Fietsenplan was just a symbolic thing,' he says. 'We painted a few bikes white, that"},{"t":"was all. Things got more serious when I became a member of the Amsterdam city","x":0.24473987016457291,"h":0.018948859404618879,"w":0.6731014506022136,"c":1,"y":0.5930342621347906},{"x":0.24691358002283409,"w":0.19547325134277344,"t":"council two years later.'","h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"y":0.60895170803784304},{"t":"C Schimmelpennink seized this opportunity to present a more elaborate Witte","y":0.63798257665116043,"x":0.20351800421197558,"h":0.021018202369429306,"c":1,"w":0.66083862304687502},{"y":0.65421307125633854,"h":0.019324434098422327,"c":1,"x":0.24471576860208907,"t":"Fietsenplan to the city council. 'My idea was that the municipality of Amsterdam","w":0.65253611246744792},{"x":0.24469269012093076,"y":0.66816606804180811,"t":"would distribute 10,000 white bikes over the city, for everyone to use,' he explains.","h":0.021733554709786107,"w":0.67734471638997396,"c":1},{"w":0.64845133463541671,"t":"'I made serious calculations. It turned out that a white bicycle - per person, per","c":1,"x":0.24674148860226977,"y":0.68555192565749568,"h":0.01824517244444579},{"c":1,"y":0.7019866114195944,"t":"kilometre - would cost the municipality only 10% of what it contributed to public","x":0.24479101042053913,"w":0.65238978068033848,"h":0.016847869953923844},{"y":0.71694468383875165,"t":"transport per person per kilometre.' Nevertheless, the council unanimously rejected","x":0.24476955522366184,"h":0.016669039731873725,"w":0.6832897440592447,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.24265737004635185,"t":"the plan. 'They said that the bicycle belongs to the past. They saw a glorious future","y":0.73209356017247251,"w":0.68338862101236986,"h":0.018900430946664604},{"c":1,"t":"for the car,' says Schimmelpennink. But he was not in the least discouraged.","x":0.244712007464153,"y":0.74726893135937345,"w":0.62372411092122393,"h":0.01744157770918453},{"c":1,"h":0.019159467537636199,"t":"Schimmelpennink never stopped believing in bike-sharing, and in the mid-90s,","x":0.24061354325330911,"y":0.77741314395400318,"w":0.64843271891276044},{"t":"two Danes asked for his help to set up a system in Copenhagen. The result was","y":0.79430208793239931,"x":0.24477501147127423,"h":0.015870812082459107,"c":1,"w":0.65654179890950515},{"y":0.80930118532931161,"w":0.65242014567057294,"c":1,"x":0.24271414863979335,"t":"the world's first large-scale bike-share programme. It worked on a deposit:iYou","h":0.017212923901381516},{"t":"dropped a coin in the bike and when you returned it, you got your money back.'","h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1,"y":0.82558139521591478,"x":0.24485596069597154,"w":0.65226338704427089},{"w":0.6751501973470051,"t":"After setting up the Danish system, Schimmelpennink decided to try his luck again","h":0.019479441558514332,"c":1,"x":0.24265601925752331,"y":0.83999647687629275},{"y":0.86482558121238806,"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.20164609063813951,"w":0.024691357612609849,"c":1,"t":"20"}],"h":3395}